{"id":"6ad876d2c15e685f","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-derivative.md","title":"Derivative","display":"df-derivative — Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-derivative","aliases":["58-df-derivative","Derivative"],"display":"df-derivative — Derivative","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-derivative</span><span>Derivative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivative — Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}\">\\(f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}\\)</span> (real function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathbb{R}\">\\(x \\in \\mathbb{R}\\)</span> (point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span> (domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span> (derivative order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (derivative value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\">\\(\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(f)\">\\(D(f)\\)</span> (derivative graph defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land x,\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}-\\ell\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land x,\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}-\\ell\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}graph} \\vdash D(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}graph} \\vdash D(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value} \\vdash f&#39;(x)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in D(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value} \\vdash f&#39;(x)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in D(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}c1} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(D(f)\\upharpoonright U,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\left(|y-x|&lt;\\delta\\to|D(f)(y)-D(f)(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}c1} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(D(f)\\upharpoonright U,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\left(|y-x|&lt;\\delta\\to|D(f)(y)-D(f)(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}iterate} \\vdash D^0(f)=f\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(D^{k+1}(f)=D(D^k(f))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}iterate} \\vdash D^0(f)=f\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(D^{k+1}(f)=D(D^k(f))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^1\">\\(C^1\\)</span> predicate explicitly types <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> as a total real function, including when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\varnothing\">\\(U=\\varnothing\\)</span>; otherwise the derivative-domain clauses would be vacuous and admit arbitrary sets as functions.</li>\n<li>Derivative: rate of change, slope of tangent</li>\n<li>Chain rule: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f \\circ g)&#39; = (f&#39; \\circ g) g&#39;\">\\((f \\circ g)&#39; = (f&#39; \\circ g) g&#39;\\)</span></li>\n<li>Product rule: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(fg)&#39; = f&#39;g + fg&#39;\">\\((fg)&#39; = f&#39;g + fg&#39;\\)</span></li>\n<li>Quotient rule: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f/g)&#39; = (f&#39;g - fg&#39;)/g^2\">\\((f/g)&#39; = (f&#39;g - fg&#39;)/g^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Spivak, Calculus</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in \\mathbb{R}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)","display":false},{"tex":"D(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}at} \\vdash \\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land x,\\ell\\in\\mathbb R\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\left(0<|h|<\\delta\\to\\left|\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h}-\\ell\\right|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}graph} \\vdash D(f)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathbb R\\times\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S(f,x,\\ell)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}value} \\vdash f'(x)=\\ell\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,\\ell\\rangle\\in D(f)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}c1} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}_S(f,U)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(D(f)\\upharpoonright U,U,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\\left(|y-x|<\\delta\\to|D(f)(y)-D(f)(x)|<\\varepsilon\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}iterate} \\vdash D^0(f)=f\\land \\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\left(D^{k+1}(f)=D(D^k(f))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"C^1","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"(f \\circ g)' = (f' \\circ g) g'","display":false},{"tex":"(fg)' = f'g + fg'","display":false},{"tex":"(f/g)' = (f'g - fg')/g^2","display":false}],"bytes":2208,"backlinks":[{"id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ContinuouslyDifferentiable}$ 取 [[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"e0bca8961c66270c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e31fe4f8ff464152","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DerivativeAt}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md]])"},{"id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-415","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-derivative.md|58-df-derivative]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}